{"id":"00460","root":"uni00460_1","name":{"ja":"メルメ・エルヒェム","en":"Merme Elchim"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"メルメ・エルヒェム","en":"Merme Elchim"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2021-05-17","limited":false,"characterId":271,"profile":{"ja":"魔草使いの女。魔界において草花と共に暮らし作物を作って自給自足で暮らす一族の出身で、とある事情から故郷を離れ、ヨミハラで魔草屋を営んでいる。店は大繁盛しているわけではないが、彼女が育てる魔草は究極の一品と言われており、知る人ぞ知る隠れた名店として目の利く客の来訪が絶えない。店主の彼女はおっとりのんびりとしていて気が長く、いつもニコニコと微笑んでいるためか弱い女性と勘違いされがちだが、魔草使いのメルメは種や根さえあればあらゆる場所に魔草を生やす『萌草魔術』を用い、いざ戦いとなれば生やした多種多様な魔草をハープと踊りで操って敵を絡め取る。とはいえ基本的に争い事は嫌いなため、その力を見る機会は少ない。","en":"She is a woman who wields magical grass. Born into a family that lives self-sufficiently in the Demon Realm, cultivating crops and living with flowers, she left her hometown due to certain circumstances and now runs a magical grass shop in Yomihara. Although her shop isn't particularly prosperous, the magical grass she cultivates is said to be of the highest quality, and her store is a hidden gem known only to those in the know, attracting discerning customers. As the store owner, she is carefree and laid-back, often smiling, which can lead people to underestimate her. However, Merme, the magical grass wielder, can use her \"Sprouting Magic\" to grow magical grass anywhere, given seeds or roots, and can manipulate the diverse magical grass she has grown using her harp and dance to entangle her enemies. That being said, she generally dislikes conflict, so opportunities to see her power in action are rare."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"伊ヶ崎綾香","forms":[{"id":"uni00460_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1126,2252],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[104,208],"def":[149,298],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","1070007"]},{"id":"uni00460_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1752,3504],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[143,286],"def":[233,466],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["4","1070007","1070008"]},{"id":"uni